      "content": "that makes sense. it's kinda creepy though, thinking there could be these little weak spots or \"voids\" lurking inside a piece of wood that looks totally fine on the outside. is there any way to actually test for those hidden vulnerabilities, or am i just supposed to hope there isn't anything \"sabotaging\" the beam's strength from the inside?",
